<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device">
  <diagram id="how-it-fits" name="How it fits">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1420" pageHeight="1040" background="#fbfbf7" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:28px&quot;&gt;purrpose&lt;font color=&quot;#aa7d48&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;How the parts fit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;Solid wires carry the request. Dashed wires are calls and sources. Three agents group the six roles in FULL_GUIDANCE §16. Hover a node for its notes.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="900" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg0" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="40" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt0" value="running" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;fontColor=#62736d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="978" y="34" width="130" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg1" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#5b7fb8;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="40" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt1" value="built, not in the live flow" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;fontColor=#62736d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1128" y="34" width="130" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg2" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#aa7d48;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="40" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt2" value="not built yet" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;fontColor=#62736d;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1278" y="34" width="130" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="t1" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Donor asks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;in the chat box&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Trigger · our app&#10;&#10;A supporter types in the chat, in their own words: “any kitties near the capital?”, “where does the money go?”, or in Chinese. The app asks which city they prefer and never asks for a name or an amount.&#10;&#10;• Starts a conversation turn for one session&#10;• Places outside Ontario get an explicit “we only cover Ontario” notice&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R04 · FULL_GUIDANCE §5"><mxCell style="shape=delay;flipH=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="180" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-t1" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMjI0ZjQzIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuNyIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48cGF0aCBkPSJNMTMgMyA1IDEzaDZsLTEgOCA4LTEwaC02bDEtOHoiLz48L3N2Zz4=;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-t1" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="t1"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="t2" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Rescue updates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;public page changed&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Trigger · our app&#10;&#10;A rescue’s public page changes, or a supporter explicitly says “refresh Lucy”. A notification alone is not evidence: the page has to be read and checked.&#10;&#10;• Re-reviews only the checks the change affects&#10;• Starts from what memory already holds&#10;• A source refresh needs the user’s explicit words; a model guess cannot trigger one&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R05, R10 · FULL_GUIDANCE §6, §12"><mxCell style="shape=delay;flipH=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="390" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-t2" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="t2"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-t2" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="t2"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="agent" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Orchestrator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;the coordinator · plans each step&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Our code · conversation.py, core.py, real_review.py&#10;&#10;One program that decides which agent works next, what to skip and when to stop, within the budget. It hands every decision about money and qualification to plain code.&#10;&#10;• Asks the configured model what the user wants, then validates the answer&#10;• Starts only the agents the current evidence needs&#10;• Never lets a model change facts, money or qualification (R12)&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R12, R13 · FULL_GUIDANCE §16"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=66;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="280" width="270" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-agent" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="agent"><mxGeometry x="18" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-agent" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="agent"><mxGeometry x="263" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="collector" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Evidence Collector Agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;gathers permitted evidence&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Agent · spec roles identity_risk, rescue_need, funding_channel&#10;&#10;Gathers relevant evidence from permitted public sources only. For the demo it uses prepared sources: two fixed Lucy articles, saved official observations, and fictional sources for Maple.&#10;&#10;• Identity and risk: registration and organization checks&#10;• Rescue need: links the request and medical material to the same cat&#10;• Funding and channel: costs, amounts raised, grants and the donation link&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Note: No general web search. Unknown links stay unassessed; private uploads are refused.&#10;&#10;Read: R05, R07, R09 · FULL_GUIDANCE §16"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530" y="280" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-collector" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="collector"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-collector" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="collector"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="evaluator" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Evidence Evaluator Agent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;supported, conflict or not supported&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Agent · spec role evaluator&#10;&#10;Checks every finding for source credibility, conflicting information and missing evidence, and says clearly what remains unverified instead of forcing a positive result.&#10;&#10;• Supported: the source backs it, dates fit, same cat → accepted&#10;• Conflict: sources disagree → sent to the Dispute Resolver with a specific question&#10;• Not supported: no source, wrong cat or out of date → rejected, the gap stays visible&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Note: This is the “more advanced yes/no”: a verdict per finding, before the six checks judge the whole case.&#10;&#10;Read: R06, R07 · FULL_GUIDANCE §16.2"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="280" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-evaluator" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="evaluator"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-evaluator" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="evaluator"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="resolver" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Dispute Resolver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;investigates one conflict&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Agent · spec role dispute_resolver&#10;&#10;Investigates one specific conflict the Evaluator raised, using dated, sourced evidence, then hands it back to the Evaluator.&#10;&#10;• Lucy: “pregnant” (13 Oct) vs “gave birth” (14 Oct) is a dated progression, not a contradiction&#10;• Maple: is the grant already inside the amount raised?&#10;• Cannot invent missing facts; an unresolved conflict stays unresolved&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Note: Low-credit demo limit: one targeted repair round per review. Only these two conflict types are implemented so far.&#10;&#10;Read: FULL_GUIDANCE §16.3, §16.4"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="110" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-resolver" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="resolver"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-resolver" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="resolver"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="checks" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Six checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;and funding maths, in code&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Our code&#10;&#10;Plain code with no model involved. It runs the six checks and calculates the remaining amount. Unknown stays unknown and is never counted as zero.&#10;&#10;• Identity, medical, costs dated, positive remainder, donation link, risk&#10;• Maple: 2,000 − 700 − 300 = 1,000 once the grant is known to be separate&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R06, R08 · FULL_GUIDANCE §7, §9"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="280" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-checks" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMjI0ZjQzIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuNyIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48cGF0aCBkPSJNNSA0aDE0djE2SDV6Ii8+PHBhdGggZD0ibTggOSAyIDIgNC00TTggMTVoOCIvPjwvc3ZnPg==;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="checks"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-checks" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="checks"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="gate" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;All six pass?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;qualified or pending&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Our code&#10;&#10;The fork in the road for the whole case. Only a case that passes every check is shown as qualified. Anything else is pending, with the reason.&#10;&#10;• Qualification applies to this case only, not to every request by the organization&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R06"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="280" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-gate" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="gate"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-gate" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="gate"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="qual" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Show qualified case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;with every source&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Result page&#10;&#10;The supporter sees the case, its sources and the remaining amount, plus what has not been independently confirmed.&#10;&#10;• Ordered by city, organization and case name, never by a trust score&#10;&#10;Today: Running (fictional case only)&#10;&#10;Note: Only the fictional Maple case can reach this today. Lucy’s real medical, funding and risk evidence is incomplete.&#10;&#10;Read: R04 · FULL_GUIDANCE §5.4"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="140" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-qual" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="qual"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-qual" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="qual"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="link" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Rescue’s own donation link&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;Purrpose handles no money&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="External link&#10;&#10;A checked link to the organization’s own donation channel. Purrpose never takes, sends or processes money.&#10;&#10;• The link is checked to belong to the same organization (check 5)&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R15 · FULL_GUIDANCE §10"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="140" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-link" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="link"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-link" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="link"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="pend" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Show pending case&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;what is missing, and where&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Result page&#10;&#10;An honest pending result: the known facts, what is missing, and where it could come from. Missing information does not mean dishonesty.&#10;&#10;• Never invents a remaining amount&#10;• Lucy is shown here: registered charity, kittens born, remaining need unknown&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R06 · FULL_GUIDANCE §5.4"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="430" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-pend" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="pend"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-pend" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="pend"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="gaps" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Gap list for the rescue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;what to add and why&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Result page&#10;&#10;The rescue gets a practical list of what is satisfied, missing or conflicting, and what to add to its own public page. System checks still owed are not blamed on the rescue.&#10;&#10;• Public links only, no private uploads&#10;• A stated role does not verify who someone is&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R05 · FULL_GUIDANCE §6"><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=150;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="430" width="92" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-gaps" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMjI0ZjQzIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuNyIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48cGF0aCBkPSJNOSA2aDExTTkgMTJoMTFNOSAxOGgxMU00IDZoLjAxTTQgMTJoLjAxTTQgMThoLjAxIi8+PC9zdmc+;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="gaps"><mxGeometry x="29" y="29" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-gaps" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="gaps"><mxGeometry x="85" y="-5" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="provider" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Model provider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;one route, chosen in settings&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="provider.py · PURRPOSE_MODEL_PROVIDER&#10;&#10;Sends the chat message to exactly one configured route. The model only proposes the user’s intent as small JSON; chat_intent.py validates it and code writes the reply.&#10;&#10;• Owner-set caps: 200 calls and 100,000 tokens per run, 20 per minute, 30 s timeout&#10;• No retries and no automatic switch between providers&#10;• Payments, rule changes, negations and refreshes never reach the model&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R12, R13 · FULL_GUIDANCE §17, §18"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="197" y="490" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-provider" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="provider"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-provider" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="provider"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="runtime" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Meterless Runtime&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;via Nightshift&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Hackathon Power rule · route “meterless”&#10;&#10;The switchboard route: our app sends model requests to the local Runtime with a real token and the meterless-app and meterless-scope headers, and Nightshift passes them to its configured model.&#10;&#10;• Discovers routing modes from GET /v1/models before use&#10;• Satisfies the rule “Meterless Nightshift as primary AI provider” once a runtime answers&#10;&#10;Today: Built, not tested live&#10;&#10;Note: Nightshift for Windows needs a dedicated GPU, so no runtime has been reachable and this route is tested only offline. Direct NVIDIA calls do not count as Nightshift use.&#10;&#10;Read: FULL_GUIDANCE §19 Nightshift"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="710" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-runtime" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMjI0ZjQzIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuNyIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48cGF0aCBkPSJNNyAzdjVNMTcgM3Y1TTUgOGgxNHY0YTcgNyAwIDAgMS0xNCAwVjh6TTEyIDE5djIiLz48L3N2Zz4=;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="runtime"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-runtime" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#5b7fb8;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="runtime"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="direct" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Direct NVIDIA API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;no-GPU route&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Route “nvidia_direct”&#10;&#10;Calls NVIDIA’s hosted API directly with the account owner’s own key, kept in a local .env.local that never goes into Git. This is the route the Meterless team allowed for machines without a GPU.&#10;&#10;• Fixed address: integrate.api.nvidia.com&#10;• Thinking turned off, so a reply costs about 400 tokens and 1–8 seconds&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Note: Tested live on 25 Oct 2026. It does not count as Nightshift use.&#10;&#10;Read: FULL_GUIDANCE §19 NVIDIA"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="197" y="710" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-direct" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="direct"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-direct" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="direct"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="fallback" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Fixed phrases&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;no model, or it failed&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="conversation.py · bounded matching&#10;&#10;When no provider is configured, or the model fails, times out, hits a cap or returns something invalid, the chat falls back to fixed phrase matching. The reply says which path was used.&#10;&#10;• Keeps the app working for judges without keys&#10;• Never pretends a model answered&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: FULL_GUIDANCE §17"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="334" y="710" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-fallback" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMjI0ZjQzIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuNyIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48cGF0aCBkPSJNNSA2aDE0TTUgMTJoMTBNNSAxOGg3Ii8+PC9zdmc+;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="fallback"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-fallback" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="fallback"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="nemotron" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;NVIDIA Nemotron&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;hosted model&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b&#10;&#10;The model behind either route. In the chat it proposes what the user wants. Separately, one authorized test showed it can propose cost facts from a document, each with its exact quote.&#10;&#10;• Proposes intents and candidate facts only&#10;• Code checks every proposal before use&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R12 · FULL_GUIDANCE §17"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="128" y="875" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-nemotron" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="nemotron"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-nemotron" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="nemotron"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="hmem" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;H-MEM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;Meterless memory engine&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Hackathon Build rule&#10;&#10;Memory with citations. Every review keeps its sources and open gaps, and nothing is overwritten. It runs from Meterless’s official reference code.&#10;&#10;• Recalls what is already known and what is still open&#10;• Saves each review; history answers use only what was known then&#10;&#10;Today: Running when configured&#10;Proof: The application’s memory tests pass with the official reference configured.&#10;&#10;Read: R11 · FULL_GUIDANCE §14"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="386" y="490" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-hmem" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMjI0ZjQzIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuNyIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48cGF0aCBkPSJNNSA0aDExbDMgM3YxM0g1eiIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik04IDloOE04IDEzaDhNOCAxN2g1Ii8+PC9zdmc+;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="hmem"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-hmem" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="hmem"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="public" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Public pages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;two fixed Lucy articles&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Source · public_reader.py&#10;&#10;The Guelph Humane Society’s own articles about Lucy, read over HTTPS within robots, size and time limits, and only when explicitly requested.&#10;&#10;• Rescue-need evidence, with exact quotes and dates&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: R05, R07"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="690" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="ic-public" value="" style="shape=image;image=data:image/svg+xml,;imageAspect=1;movable=0;resizable=0;editable=0;" vertex="1" parent="public"><mxGeometry x="19" y="19" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="st-public" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#3f8a66;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="public"><mxGeometry x="50.1" y="3.9" width="12" height="12" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject id="saved" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Saved research&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;official lookups, by hand&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Source · research_case.py&#10;&#10;Prepared, dated observations: the CRA charity listing (registered) and the linked donation form’s allocation wording.&#10;&#10;• Identity check evidence&#10;• How extra donations are used&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Note: Saved by hand on 24 Oct 2026; not refreshed automatically.&#10;&#10;Read: R09 · FULL_GUIDANCE §13"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="690" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
