        <UserObject id="fixture" label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Fictional sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#62736d&quot;&gt;Maple demo only&lt;/span&gt;" tooltip="Source · fixtures&#10;&#10;Made-up case pages and funding disclosures for the Maple demo. Shown only when someone asks for the fictional demo by name.&#10;&#10;• Demonstrates the full review, including a repair and a qualified result&#10;• Can never qualify a real case&#10;&#10;Today: Running&#10;&#10;Read: FULL_GUIDANCE §26"><mxCell style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c7bc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#203c35;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;labelPosition=center;align=center;spacingTop=4;labelWidth=120;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="690" width="66" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
